/: uav_analysis_criteria.ncds
/: UAV Analysis Criteria — load defaults and refine with operator in discussion
/:
/: Dispatched from uav_error_check.ncds via Distribute.
/: Loads default criteria for the mission type, presents them to the operator,
/: and enters a discussion loop so the operator can modify, add, or remove
/: criteria before analysis begins. Returns finalised criteria.
/:
/: Execution order (inside-out, top-down):
/:   default criteria      — load rule-based defaults for mission type  (depends on approved plan)
/:   on-going discussion   — self-seed empty                            (no deps)
/:   all discussion turns  — ReAct loop: present criteria, read input,
/:                           apply modifications, check approval        (depends on defaults)
/:   finalised criteria    — return operator-approved criteria          (root)
/:
/: Loop pattern (inside each iteration, top-down):
/:   operator message  — present current state and read operator response (runs first)
/:   updated criteria  — apply operator modifications                     (depends on message)
/:   is criteria approved? — judge if operator has approved              (depends on both above)
/:   on-going discussion   — conditional append gate                      (runs last)
/:
/: Agents:
/:   user_agent     — presents criteria, reads operator input, judges approval.
/:   analysis_agent — applies operator modifications to criteria.

<- finalised criteria
    <= confirm and return operator-approved criteria

    <- default criteria
        <= load default analysis criteria for this mission type
        <- approved plan

    <- on-going discussion
        <= initialize to empty discussion

    <- all discussion turns
        <= for every on-going message

            <= return the discussion turn per iteration

            <- discussion turn
                <= bundle operator message and updated criteria together

                <- operator message
                    /: [user_agent]
                    <= present current criteria and read operator response
                    <- on-going discussion

                <- updated criteria
                    /: [analysis_agent]
                    <= apply operator modifications to current criteria
                    <- operator modifications
                        /: [user_agent]
                        <= extract requested modifications from operator message
                        <- operator message
                    <- default criteria
                    <- on-going discussion

            <- is criteria approved?
                /: [user_agent]
                <= judge if operator has approved the criteria
                <- operator message
                <- updated criteria

            <- on-going discussion
                <= append discussion turn to on-going discussion
                    <= if criteria NOT yet approved
                    <* is criteria approved?
                <- discussion turn
                <- on-going discussion

        <- on-going discussion
        <* message in on-going discussion

    <- approved plan
